"""StarlingX Health, Fault & Alert Integration Validation — Phase 28F.

Validates that the Phase 28E StarlingX Provider integrates correctly with
the existing Health, Fault Detection, Alert, Visibility, and Management API
pipeline.

Pipeline under test:
    StarlingXProviderAdapter.collect(fixture)
        -> RawProviderSnapshot
        -> StarlingXProviderNormalizer.normalize()
        -> CanonicalInventory
        -> HealthService.assess()  (StarlingXHealthExtractor)
        -> HealthReport
        -> MonitoringService.monitor()
        -> MonitoringReport (Observations + StateChanges)
        -> FaultDetectionService.detect()
        -> FaultResult (Faults with lifecycle)
        -> AlertService.create_alert(fault)
        -> Alerts (OPEN)
        -> OperationalVisibilityService.get_summary()

All fixtures are synthetic/in-memory. No live connection.
"""
